   n =   100000: D = 1.096 (0.020)      [the level problem: 1.081, good to about 0.06]
   n =  1000000: D = 1.094 (0.022)      [the level problem: 1.081, good to about 0.06]
   n = 10000000: D = 1.078 (0.085)      [the level problem: 1.081, good to about 0.06]
   and with exactly n points, what is left when the predicted part of the count of points is taken off (the rest of D, predicted 0.300):
   n =   100000: the rest of D = 0.313 (0.009)
   n =  1000000: the rest of D = 0.299 (0.009)
   n = 10000000: the rest of D = 0.259 (0.032)

